    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE: JULY 1, 1952\nCOMPLETE SYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEASTERN\nAIR LINES\nEnjoy one of EASTERN'S low-cost\n\"HAPPY HOLIDAYS\"\nTo FLORIDA - PUERTO RICO - VIRGIN ISLANDS -\nMEXICO - NASSAU - HAVANA - NEW ENGLAND\nThere's no substitute for\nEASTERN'S EXPERIENCE\nSAVE 10% ON RETURN TICKET\nALWAYS BUY ROUND TRIP",
